#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/guides/performance-hil.md:9
msgid "Measure resources and prepare hardware acceptance"
msgstr "测量资源并准备硬件验收"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/guides/performance-hil.md:11
msgid ""
"Use this guide to separate linked software costs from physical MCU behavior."
" The platform supplies measurement and HIL tooling; products choose "
"workloads, electrical limits, safe outputs and release policy. No Board is "
"physically qualified until real equipment executes its reviewed scope."
msgstr ""
"使用本指南区分链接后的软件成本与物理 MCU 行为。平台提供测量与 HIL "
"工具；产品选择工作负载、电气限制、安全输出和发行策略。真实设备执行已审查范围之前，任何 Board 都没有实板资格。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/guides/performance-hil.md:16
msgid ""
"Prepare the [fixed source and recursive dependencies](source-checkout.md), "
"then the locked toolchain for the exact selected assembly."
msgstr "先准备[固定源码与递归依赖](source-checkout.md)，再为精确选择的装配准备锁定工具链。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/guides/performance-hil.md:19
msgid "Measure an exact image"
msgstr "测量精确镜像"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/guides/performance-hil.md:21
msgid ""
"Record clean source, assembly/resolved digest, dependencies, compiler and "
"flags. Build the same workload before and after a change. Check actual "
"ELF/BIN/map and resource reports, not estimates derived from object counts. "
"Separate Flash LOAD, Flash footprint, each physical RAM reservation, MSP, "
"task stack/TCB, queue and I/O buffers. Stack capacity is not a measured "
"stack high-water value."
msgstr ""
"记录干净源码、装配／resolved 摘要、依赖、编译器和标志。在变更前后构建同一负载。核对实际 ELF／BIN／map "
"与资源报告，不使用对象数量估算。分别记录 Flash LOAD、Flash 占用范围、各物理 RAM 预留、MSP、任务栈／TCB、队列和 I/O "
"缓冲区。栈容量不是实测栈高水位。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/guides/performance-hil.md:27
msgid ""
"The [build contract](../design/build-system.md) owns resource checks. Use "
"maintained `tools/measurement/` gates; [execution budgets](../design/soc-"
"execution-budgets.md) state scope. A speed claim needs units, clock, input "
"size, load, sampling method and uncertainty. DWT 32-bit snapshots require a "
"bounded wrap interval; host arrival timestamps do not establish MCU cycles "
"or IRQ latency."
msgstr ""
"[构建合同](../design/build-system.md)维护资源检查。使用维护中的 `tools/measurement/` "
"门禁；[执行预算](../design/soc-execution-"
"budgets.md)说明范围。速度结论必须包含单位、时钟、输入规模、负载、采样方法和不确定度。DWT 32 "
"位快照需要有界回绕间隔；主机到达时间戳不能证明 MCU cycles 或 IRQ 延迟。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/guides/performance-hil.md:33
msgid ""
"![H743 exact memory and Cache ownership "
"reference](../assets/diagrams/h743-memory-cache.svg)"
msgstr "![H743 精确内存与缓存所有权参考](../assets/diagrams/h743-memory-cache.svg)"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/guides/performance-hil.md:33
msgid "H743 exact memory and Cache ownership reference"
msgstr "H743 精确内存与缓存所有权参考"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/guides/performance-hil.md:35
msgid ""
"FIG-09 is an exact H743 reference. Cache-enabled TX requires complete "
"32-byte line ownership and AXI SRAM reachability; DMA completion, wire "
"completion and borrow settlement are separate. It does not authorize RX DMA "
"or TCM placement."
msgstr ""
"FIG-09 是精确 H743 参考。启用缓存的 TX 要求拥有完整 32 字节缓存行，并可达 AXI SRAM；DMA "
"完成、线上完成和借用结束分别判断。它不授权 RX DMA 或 TCM 放置。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/guides/performance-hil.md:39
msgid "Compare costs without changing the question"
msgstr "保持同一问题再比较成本"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/guides/performance-hil.md:41
msgid ""
"Resource regression compares equivalent CPU, ABI, optimization, clock, "
"backend, routes, modes, stack/heap budgets and compiler identity. Use "
"explicit nonnegative growth limits for each metric. A comparison that adds a"
" controller, slot or mode explains marginal cost; it does not prove an "
"equivalent implementation became smaller. Keep actual ELF files and load-"
"layout reports with the comparison."
msgstr ""
"资源回归比较等价的 CPU、ABI、优化、时钟、后端、路由、模式、栈／heap 预算和编译器身份。每项指标使用显式非负增长上限。新增控制器、slot "
"或模式的比较解释边际成本，不能证明等价实现变小。随比较保留实际 ELF 文件和装载布局报告。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/guides/performance-hil.md:47
msgid ""
"Flash LOAD, RAM intervals, provider state, buffers and reserved RTOS storage"
" are separate views; nested categories must not be summed twice. Product "
"stack usage cannot be inferred from an arbitrary symbol name. Dynamic high-"
"water marks require measurement. Shared operation tables need a retained-"
"symbol audit in actual ELF variants before changing their organization; no "
"measured benefit means no production table split justified by this "
"experiment."
msgstr ""
"Flash LOAD、RAM 区间、provider 状态、缓冲区和预留 RTOS "
"存储是不同观察视角；嵌套类别不能重复累加。不能由任意符号名称推断产品栈使用量。动态 high-water mark "
"需要测量。改变共享操作表组织前，必须审计实际 ELF 变体中保留的符号；没有测得收益，本实验就不能成为拆分生产方法表的依据。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/guides/performance-hil.md:54
msgid ""
"Physical IRQ latency and throughput require raw acquisition, explicit units,"
" image/station identity, clock and load. A host test duration is not MCU "
"cycles; the largest observed latency is not WCET. Unexecuted measurements "
"remain `not_executed`, without guessed thresholds or converted model "
"results."
msgstr ""
"物理 IRQ 延迟和吞吐需要原始采集、明确单位、镜像／测试站身份、时钟及负载。host 测试耗时不是 MCU cycle；观测到的最大延迟不是 "
"WCET。未执行的测量保持 `not_executed`，不猜测阈值或转换模型结果。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/guides/performance-hil.md:59
msgid "Prepare without operating equipment"
msgstr "在不操作设备的情况下准备"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/guides/performance-hil.md:61
msgid ""
"First configure and build the selected maintained assembly. For the "
"Liangshan baremetal reference, these repository-root commands consume its "
"actual output:"
msgstr "先配置并构建所选维护装配。以下仓库根目录命令使用梁山派裸机参考的实际输出："

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/guides/performance-hil.md:71
msgid ""
"The locked ARM compiler must be on `PATH`. Check the part, pins, selected "
"modes and `not_executed` cases in reports. Preparation does not open serial,"
" flash or power equipment. Numeric limits and instruments remain unbound "
"until reviewed. G474/H743/U575 software-reference fixtures deliberately "
"reject physical station admission; a future physical fixture needs "
"separately reviewed tooling integration."
msgstr ""
"锁定 ARM 编译器必须位于 `PATH`。检查报告中的型号、引脚、选择模式和 `not_executed` "
"项。准备流程不打开串口、不刷写，也不操作电源设备。数值限制和仪器在审查前保持未绑定。G474／H743／U575 "
"软件参考夹具会明确拒绝物理工位准入；未来实板夹具需要独立审查的工具集成。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/guides/performance-hil.md:77
msgid ""
"The [selected-mode HIL contracts](../design/selected-mode-hil.md) add exact "
"preparation for H743 Cache-enabled SPI4 DMA, continuous USART3 RX with IRQ "
"TX, and separately selected finite TX-DMA/continuous RX duplex, plus U575 "
"finite USART1 hardware-chain TX and LPTIM2 RUN one-shots. Select their "
"maintained assemblies and keep independent mode, wire, memory and lifecycle "
"observations. These protocols retain the software-reference fixture boundary"
" above; a valid plan or synthetic parser test does not supply a physical "
"station result."
msgstr ""
"[选定模式 HIL 合同](../design/selected-mode-hil.md)为 H743 开启 Cache 的 SPI4 DMA、使用 "
"IRQ TX 的连续 USART3 RX，以及独立选择的有限 TX DMA／连续 RX 双向模式，另为 U575 有限 USART1 硬件链 TX 和 "
"LPTIM2 RUN 单次计数增加精确准备。选择对应维护中的装配，并分别保留模式、线上、内存和生命周期观察记录。这些协议保留上面的软件参考 "
"fixture 边界；有效计划或合成 parser 测试不提供实板 station 结果。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/guides/performance-hil.md:85
msgid ""
"ThreadX preparation uses [independent acquisition "
"contracts](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/tools/hil/threadx.md) for tasks, IRQ wake, context, stack, deadlines,"
" lifecycle and fail-stop. Select one of the three maintained M4 Boards for a"
" physical plan; Native establishes host software behavior only. Generate the"
" OS plan from the exact resolved ThreadX configuration with "
"`tools/hil/os_acceptance.py plan`. These seven cases do not inherit FreeRTOS"
" low-power acceptance contracts. Their plans remain `prepared_unbound` / "
"`not_executed` until real equipment supplies the required observations and "
"the full station admission succeeds."
msgstr ""
"ThreadX 准备使用[独立采集合同](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-"
"DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/tools/hil/threadx.md)，覆盖任务、IRQ 唤醒、上下文、栈、deadline、生命周期和 "
"fail-stop。物理计划必须选择三块受维护 M4 Board 之一；Native 只建立主机软件行为证据。通过 "
"`tools/hil/os_acceptance.py plan` 从精确解析后的 ThreadX 配置生成 OS 计划。这七项不会沿用 "
"FreeRTOS 低功耗验收合同。在真实设备提供必需观察记录且完整 station 准入成功之前，计划仍为 "
"`prepared_unbound`／`not_executed`。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/guides/performance-hil.md:94
msgid "Execute only a real reviewed station"
msgstr "只执行真实且经过审查的工位"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/guides/performance-hil.md:96
msgid ""
"Bind observed PCB/part/UID, probe, stable serial path, wiring and supply to "
"the exact ELF, resolved configuration and resource report. Pin acquisition "
"tools, recipe, instruments and numeric lower/upper limits. Follow the "
"maintained HIL acquisition contract: identify, flash, verify, reset, serial,"
" cleanup. Failure preserves raw logs; cleanup failure retains station "
"quarantine and requires physical inspection."
msgstr ""
"将实际观察的 PCB／型号／UID、探针、稳定串口路径、接线和供电绑定到精确 ELF、resolved "
"配置与资源报告。锁定采集工具、操作配方、仪器和数值上下限。遵守维护中的 HIL "
"采集合同：识别、刷写、验证、复位、串口和清理。失败保留原始日志；清理失败继续隔离保留工位，并要求实物检查。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/guides/performance-hil.md:102
msgid ""
"Capture completion means executed but unqualified. Validate the actual "
"smoke, measurement and OS records separately. Do not synthesize physical "
"traces or convert a software model into HIL. Qualification covers recorded "
"observations; it does not establish unobserved WCET, electrical safety or a "
"product release."
msgstr ""
"采集完成只表示执行过，尚未取得资格。分别验证实际基本功能检查、测量和 OS 记录。不得合成物理跟踪记录或将软件模型当作 "
"HIL。资格只覆盖已记录观察，不证明未观察的 WCET、电气安全或产品发行。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/guides/performance-hil.md:107
msgid "Compare two admitted raw measurements"
msgstr "比较两份已准入的原始测量"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/guides/performance-hil.md:109
msgid ""
"After actual acquisition, compare two existing raw records and their station"
" admissions. Run from the same fixed source root; use a new report path you "
"own:"
msgstr "实际采集后，比较两份已有原始记录及其 station 准入。从同一固定源码根目录执行，使用自己拥有的新报告路径："

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/guides/performance-hil.md:121
msgid ""
"Both admissions and raw traces are revalidated, including their permitted "
"age (`--maximum-age-s` defaults to 86400). Comparison requires matching "
"hardware, station, fixture, effective configuration profile, workload bytes,"
" clock, load, executor, IRQ policy, measurement method, calibration, "
"resolution, observation window and metric sample counts. Source and ELF "
"identities may differ for an implementation comparison; acquisition-specific"
" DWT epochs may also differ. Source provenance is retained separately from "
"effective configuration equality. Changing the workload or mode answers a "
"different question and rejects here."
msgstr ""
"重新验证两份准入和原始 trace，包括允许的时效（`--maximum-age-s` 默认为 "
"86400）。比较要求硬件、station、fixture、有效配置 profile、负载字节、时钟、负载状态、执行者、IRQ "
"策略、测量方法、校准、分辨率、观测窗口及各指标样本数一致。实现对比允许源码和 ELF 身份不同，采集专属的 DWT epoch "
"也可以不同。源码溯源与有效配置相等性分开保留。改变负载或模式回答的是另一个问题，此入口会拒绝。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/guides/performance-hil.md:130
msgid ""
"The report retains original metrics and signed minimum, maximum and mean "
"deltas. Success is `status = compared` with `physical_status = "
"comparison_only`: it compares previously acquired observations and never "
"operates equipment. It does not label a direction as better, establish "
"statistical significance, infer WCET or promote a candidate. Synthetic "
"regression traces only test the comparison contract. Without actual raw "
"acquisitions, physical measurements remain `not_executed`; no baseline "
"values or thresholds are fabricated."
msgstr ""
"报告保留原指标及带符号的最小值、最大值和均值差量。成功时 `status = compared`、`physical_status = "
"comparison_only`：它只比较已采集观测，从不操作设备。它不会把某个变化方向标为更优，不建立统计显著性、不推断 "
"WCET，也不提升候选资格。合成回归 trace 只验证比较合同。没有实际原始采集时，物理测量仍为 `not_executed`；不编造基线值或阈值。"
